                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c549c8a5-a4be-313e-9d3b-fb7cb23bc093",
                        "entry_id": "e9ac8505-97f7-3fd2-90d1-a3e5174834c5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "currant (berry and plant)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "relational"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "08eb4c9f-f141-40f2-ae60-5f0da771abc6",
                                "sense_id": "c549c8a5-a4be-313e-9d3b-fb7cb23bc093",
                                "text": "— Во́дки не уго́дно ли? — спроси́л го́лос.\n— Я не пью; поко́рно благодарю́, — ещё ла́сковее сказа́л Обло́мов. — У вас кака́я?\n— Своя́, дома́шняя: са́ми наста́иваем на сморо́динном листу́, — говори́л го́лос.",
                                "translation": "“Wouldn’t you like some vodka?” asked the voice.\n“I don’t drink, thank you kindly,” said Oblomov even more graciously. “What kind do you have?”\n“My own, homemade. We steep it with currant leaf,” said the voice.",
                                "english": "“Wouldn’t you like some vodka?” asked the voice.\n“I don’t drink, thank you kindly,” said Oblomov even more graciously. “What kind do you have?”\n“My own, homemade. We steep it with currant leaf,” said the voice."
                            }
                        ]
